    "text": "For a positive integer m, let Gm be the largest group generated by m invo-\nlutions such that (xy)4 = 1 for any two involutions x, y ∈ Gm . What is the order of\nG4 ?\n    It is known that the order of G3 is equal to 211 . Also cf. 18.58. D. V. Lytkina",
